      "message": "fix(xtask): a known-fail reason must start a message line\n\nThe motion entry reason \"hops \" also occurs inside the refusal assert\nmessage of the same test. Match the reason only at the start of a line\nof the panic message, and pin the refusal message as a different reason.\n\nRefs #1950\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
